 },
 "loss_rate": "<div class=\"two-voice nut-lossrate\"><p class=\"tv-machine\"><span class=\"tv-mark\">›</span> actual deficit not published → protein floor 0 of 13 days </p><p class=\"tv-human\">A fast rate is contested. The bench is split on it — defensible early at this size if it's monitored, but only while the protein floor holds, and right now that floor's missed most days. That's why the rate and the protein sit on the same line here.</p></div>",
 "deficit_sustainability": "<section class=\"rd-sec\"><h2 class=\"rd-h\">Is the cut costing you? — the five-channel read</h2><div class=\"dsx-verdict dsx-sev-ok\"><span class=\"dsx-count mono\">0/5</span><span class=\"dsx-vtext\">The body's absorbing the deficit — recovery, sleep, and output are holding while the weight comes off.</span></div><div class=\"dsx-rows\"><div class=\"dsx-row dsx-hold\"><span class=\"dsx-name\">HRV</span><span class=\"dsx-dir mono\">→</span><span class=\"dsx-status label\">holding</span></div><div class=\"dsx-row dsx-hold\"><span class=\"dsx-name\">Recovery</span><span class=\"dsx-dir mono\">↓ -4%</span><span class=\"dsx-status label\">holding</span></div></div><p class=\"rd-meta label\">Eating ~1,000 calories a day against an estimated 3,000 to maintain (TDEE, total daily energy expenditure). The deficit itself is not published. The five channels — HRV, sleep quality, recovery, habit adherence, training output — are watched together: a deficit that's working shows up as the weight falling while these <em>hold</em>; one that's costing too much shows up as three or more slipping at once. A single strained channel is noise, not a verdict. Correlative, n=1 — an early signal, never alarm.</p></section>",
 "calorie_chart": "<figure class=\"chart chart--spined\"><div class=\"chart-spine\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"chart-spine-v mono\">1100 kcal</span><span class=\"chart-spine-v mono\">950 kcal</span></div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 130\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calories vs maintenance: 5 readings, May 5–May 9, latest 1100 kcal, trending up, goal 3000 kcal — off scale, 1900 kcal above the plotted range.\" data-cpts=\"[{&quot;x&quot;:0.0133,&quot;y&quot;:0.6462,&quot;l&quot;:&quot;May 5 · 1000 kcal&quot;},{&quot;x&quot;:0.2567,&quot;y&quot;:0.0615,&quot;l&quot;:&quot;May 6 · 1100 kcal&quot;},{&quot;x&quot;:0.5,&quot;y&quot;:0.9385,&quot;l&quot;:&quot;May 7 · 950 kcal&quot;},{&quot;x&quot;:0.7433,&quot;y&quot;:0.6462,&quot;l&quot;:&quot;May 8 · 1000 kcal&quot;},{&quot;x&quot;:0.9867,&quot;y&quot;:0.0615,&quot;l&quot;:&quot;May 9 · 1100 kcal&quot;}]\"><path class=\"chart-fill\" d=\"M8.0 122.0 L8.0 84.0 L154.0 8.0 L300.0 122.0 L446.0 84.0 L592.0 8.0 L592.0 122.0 Z\"/><line class=\"chart-goal chart-goal--off\" x1=\"8\" y1=\"4.0\" x2=\"592\" y2=\"4.0\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><path class=\"chart-line\" d=\"M8.0 84.0 L154.0 8.0 L300.0 122.0 L446.0 84.0 L592.0 8.0\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"592.0\" cy=\"8.0\" r=\"3.5\"/></svg><figcaption class=\"chart-cap label\">Calories vs maintenance · goal 3000 kcal — off scale, 1900 kcal above the plotted range (annotation, not the axis) · May 5–May 9 · 5 pts</figcaption></figure>",
 "weight_chart": "<figure class=\"chart\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 130\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Weight: 5 readings, May 5–May 9, latest 1100 lb, trending up, goal 900 lb — off scale, 50 lb below the plotted range.\" data-cpts=\"[{&quot;x&quot;:0.0133,&quot;y&quot;:0.6462,&quot;l&quot;:&quot;May 5 · 1000 lb&quot;},{&quot;x&quot;:0.2567,&quot;y&quot;:0.0615,&quot;l&quot;:&quot;May 6 · 1100 lb&quot;},{&quot;x&quot;:0.5,&quot;y&quot;:0.9385,&quot;l&quot;:&quot;May 7 · 950 lb&quot;},{&quot;x&quot;:0.7433,&quot;y&quot;:0.6462,&quot;l&quot;:&quot;May 8 · 1000 lb&quot;},{&quot;x&quot;:0.9867,&quot;y&quot;:0.0615,&quot;l&quot;:&quot;May 9 · 1100 lb&quot;}]\"><path class=\"chart-fill\" d=\"M8.0 122.0 L8.0 84.0 L154.0 8.0 L300.0 122.0 L446.0 84.0 L592.0 8.0 L592.0 122.0 Z\"/><line class=\"chart-goal chart-goal--off\" x1=\"8\" y1=\"126.0\" x2=\"592\" y2=\"126.0\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><path class=\"chart-line\" d=\"M8.0 84.0 L154.0 8.0 L300.0 122.0 L446.0 84.0 L592.0 8.0\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"592.0\" cy=\"8.0\" r=\"3.5\"/></svg><figcaption class=\"chart-cap label\">Weight · goal 900 lb — off scale, 50 lb below the plotted range (annotation, not the axis) · May 5–May 9 · 5 pts</figcaption></figure>"
